{"id":"n15297-2-7","stage":3,"title":"몰려오다 · 涌来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15297-2-7-1","ko":"오늘 중부 지방에 비가 온단 얘기가 있었나요?","zh":"今天有说中部地区会下雨吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"중부","meaning":"中部","explanation":"중부：中部","readings":[{"term":"중부","audio":"/audio/da607178e47894194c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26140","senseId":"1","lemma":"중부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중부","audio":"/audio/da607178e47894194c01.mp3"}},{"text":"지방에","meaning":"地区","explanation":"지방：地区；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지방","audio":"/audio/aa8a6ab7ce21201d9d47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71323","senseId":"1","lemma":"지방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지방에","audio":"/audio/5dcb93a141bf71839f79.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"온단","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；ㄴ단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온단","audio":"/audio/41ed84d767213cb685a4.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기가","meaning":"消息","explanation":"얘기：消息；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"4","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfa